    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2025937485008970103",
      "url": "https://x.com/News5PH/status/2025937485008970103",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/News5PH/status/2025937485008970103",
      "text": "#Top5Balita | FEBRUARY 23, 2026\n\n• Nagsimula na ang confirmation of charges hearing ni dating pangulong Rodrigo Duterte sa International Criminal Court (ICC) sa The Hague, Netherlands.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/A9QhlmkHfv\nREAD:\n- https://t.co/w4jz4jGage\n- https://t.co/JAGooGoaCm\n- https://t.co/5qrCug3w12\n- https://t.co/A7BuU10f9l\n\n• Pormal nang nai-refer sa House Committee on Justice ang apat na impeachment complaints laban kay Vice Pres. Sara Duterte.\n\nHudyat ito ng paggulong ng impeachment complaint at one-year bar rule kung saan isang taon na hindi pwedeng maghain muli ng impeachment laban sa Bise.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/Nm0bubp3oC\nREAD: https://t.co/pW5SGgDkKG\nFULL POST: https://t.co/PgSgu1G9vB\n\n• Dumalo ang ilang mayors mula sa iba't ibang lugar sa bansa sa paglulunsad ng “Bagong Pilipinas, Bawat Bayan Makinabang” sa Malacañang ngayong Lunes, Feb. 23.\n\nPresent sa programa sina Pasig City Mayor Vico Sotto, Quezon City Mayor Joy Belmonte, Naga City Mayor Leni Robredo, Manila Mayor Isko Moreno, at iba pang mga alkalde.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/AQcWsJWCxO\nREAD: https://t.co/hbkv38IEd6\n\n• Pinabulaanan ni National Bureau of Investigation (NBI) director Melvin Matibag ang akusasyon ni dating presidential spokesperson Harry Roque na \"gantimpala\" ang pagkakatalaga sa kaniya sa ahensya.\n\nREAD: https://t.co/z4xSYLxupo\n\n• Umangat sa bago niyang career-high na ika-31 na puwesto si Pinay tennis star Alex Eala sa pinakabagong Women’s Tennis Association (WTA) world rankings.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/rgHREhz9Pn\nREAD: https://t.co/5lotA48DQF",
